                                                "sense_id": "29ba214a-cdd9-35f0-a9fe-f0e0834adc8d",
                                                "text": "Now, covered concrete troughs to house the cables are laid parallel with the railway lines, cheapening maintenance because of improved accessibility for inspection and repair."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a93496b3-6739-4fe7-99cd-9a40182d25dc",
                                                "sense_id": "29ba214a-cdd9-35f0-a9fe-f0e0834adc8d",
                                                "text": "It just clips on the front of the stage without any special trough, has no great power and occupies only one dimmer, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a52ae39-6e55-3917-971e-af5f48531390",
                                        "entry_id": "b005b19d-9c53-32cf-b033-0ee0dbea7936",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any similarly shaped container.",
                                            "A rectangular container used for washing or rinsing clothes."
